<td id="S6.T3.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_tt" colspan="3"><span id="S6.T3.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Benchmark Performance</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S6.T3.2.1.2" class="ltx_tr">
