<span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.p9.1" class="ltx_p">"judgement": "your judgement result, can only be ’correct’ or ’incorrect’"</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p" style="width:438.5pt;"><span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:438.5pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS4.p1.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:438.5pt;">
