<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.p17.1" class="ltx_p">&lt;information&gt; retrieved documents &lt;/information&gt;</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.34" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.34.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Step 5:<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.34.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.35" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.35.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;think&gt;</span><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.35.2" class="ltx_text"></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.36" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.36.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:438.5pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.36.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:438.5pt;">
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.p18" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.p18.1" class="ltx_p">...</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.37" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.37.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;/think&gt;</span><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.37.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.37.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold">&lt;answer&gt;</span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.38" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.38.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:438.5pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.38.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:438.5pt;">
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.p19" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.p19.1" class="ltx_p">The actual enrollment count is 90 patients.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.39" class="ltx_p"><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.39.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;/answer&gt;</span><span id="A2.SS1.p1.pic1.2.39.2" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"> 
